# Files in this repo that are not part of the website.
#
# Everything in the project directory is uploaded as a static asset, which
# is how tools/ and supabase/ have always been fetchable — that predates
# this file and is left alone deliberately, because quietly changing what
# the site serves is not this change's business.
#
# What is listed here is only the machinery added for the worker, which has
# no reason to be downloadable and would otherwise sit at /wrangler.jsonc
# and /worker/index.mjs.
worker
wrangler.jsonc
.assetsignore
